          "t5->t8 (shared_modifier)"
        ],
        "notes": "Alternative reading where the final adjunct 'from heaven' (t8) modifies the entire sequence or the initial motion in t5, rather than just the immediately preceding verb in t7."
      }
    ]
  }
}
